{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06366","headline":"送马录事赴永阳 · 李颀","name":"送马录事赴永阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子爲郡从事，主印清淮边。\n谈笑一州里，从容羣吏先。\n手持三尺令，遣决如流泉。\n太守既相许，诸公谁不然。\n孤城连海树，万室带山烟。\n春日谿湖净，芳洲葭菼连。\n炊秔蟹螯熟，下筯鲈鱼鲜。\n野鹤宿檐际，楚云飞面前。\n听歌送离曲，且驻木兰船。\n赠尔八行字，当闻佳政传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}